# `project-away` drops columns by name and by wildcard; the rest keep their order.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| sort by orderId asc
| take 2
| project-away customer*, amount
---- expected
orderId | timestamp
string  | datetime
--------+---------------------
o-0001  | 2023-12-02T08:26:08Z
o-0002  | 2023-12-07T21:01:50Z
